{c: Verse 1}
[F]Man [C]re tu kaahe na dhir dhare,        [C]Wo nir [F]mo [C]hi moh na jaane,
[G]jinaka [F]moh kare,        [F]Is jiwan ki chadhti dhalati
[F]dhup ko [C]kis ne [F]baandha,        [F]Rang pe kis ne pahare daale,
[F]rup ko [C]kis ne [F]baandha,        [F]Kaahe ye jatan kare, man re
[F]Utana hi upakaar samajh koi,        [F]jitana [C]saath [F]nibhaa de
[F]Janam-maran ka mel hai sapana,        [F]ye sap [C]na bisa [C]ra de
[F]Koi n sng mare, man re ..
